{"compatibility":"minor","safety_note_md":"# SafeStan Safety Note

Compatibility: minor.

Protected data: `y_linear`.

Generated files: `model_safe.stan`, `data_safe.json`.

Changes: promoted `y_linear` from a `transformed data` reshaping of `y` to a top-level data variable so it can be the protected observation on the left side of the likelihood. In `data_safe.json`, `y_linear` is deterministically constructed from `y` in the original loop order: `y_linear[(n - 1) * T + t] = y[n, t]`. Reordered the model block so all parameter priors occur before any model-block use of those parameters. The likelihood and posterior density are otherwise unchanged.
","model_safe_stan":"// http://www.mrc-bsu.cam.ac.uk/bugs/winbugs/Vol1.pdf
// Page 3: Rats
data {
  int<lower=0> N;
  int<lower=0> T;
  array[T] real x;
  array[N, T] real y;
  array[N * T] real y_linear;
  real xbar;
}
transformed data {
  array[T] real x_minus_xbar;

  for (t in 1 : T) {
    x_minus_xbar[t] = x[t] - xbar;
  }
}
parameters {
  array[N] real alpha;
  array[N] real beta;

  real mu_alpha;
  real mu_beta;

  real<lower=0> sigmasq_y;
  real<lower=0> sigmasq_alpha;
  real<lower=0> sigmasq_beta;
}
transformed parameters {
  real<lower=0> sigma_y;
  real<lower=0> sigma_alpha;
  real<lower=0> sigma_beta;

  sigma_y = sqrt(sigmasq_y);
  sigma_alpha = sqrt(sigmasq_alpha);
  sigma_beta = sqrt(sigmasq_beta);
}
model {
  array[N * T] real pred;

  mu_alpha ~ normal(0, 100);
  mu_beta ~ normal(0, 100);
  sigmasq_y ~ inv_gamma(0.001, 0.001);
  sigmasq_alpha ~ inv_gamma(0.001, 0.001);
  sigmasq_beta ~ inv_gamma(0.001, 0.001);
  alpha ~ normal(mu_alpha, sigma_alpha); // vectorized
  beta ~ normal(mu_beta, sigma_beta); // vectorized

  for (n in 1 : N) {
    for (t in 1 : T) {
      pred[(n - 1) * T + t] = fma(beta[n], x_minus_xbar[t], alpha[n]);
    }
  }

  y_linear ~ normal(pred, sigma_y); // vectorized
}
","data_safe_json":"{"N":4,"T":3,"x":[6.368362945655125,4.487994740074521,6.678982198392992],"xbar":4.075979752406532,"y":[[4.0,4.0,2.0],[4.0,2.0,3.0],[3.0,3.0,4.0],[2.0,3.0,3.0]],"y_linear":[4.0,4.0,2.0,4.0,2.0,3.0,3.0,3.0,4.0,2.0,3.0,3.0]}","protected_variables":["y_linear"]}
